CM_ "New-generation Model Y (Juniper), Tesla FW 2026.x. Reverse-engineered from comma route 077b771458fd542f/000000a9--5f9f91a356 (2026-09-22 16:49-17:05) against an annotated action timeline; names and enums cross-checked with the Tesla FW 2026.2 signal dataset. Covers the messages listed in dbc/used_messages.txt plus DI_state (for DashPilot). Node VEH = seen on the vehicle bus (comma bus 1, DashKit bus 1); node CH = seen ONLY on the chassis bus (comma bus 0/2, DashKit bus 0). Each message comment lists the buses it was observed on. Bytesum checksum = (id_lo + id_hi + sum of data bytes except the checksum byte) & 0xFF.";
CM_ BO_ 585 "CHANGED. Vehicle bus only, 20 Hz. DLC 3 -> 4. Byte 0 is no longer the Tesla bytesum (0 of 19597 frames match) and no CRC-8 matched: Tesla calls it SCCM_leftStalkCrc and the firmware cannot synthesize this frame until the algorithm is known. Bits 20-31 are a new 12-bit stalk angle. SCCM_washWipeButtonStatus and SCCM_highBeamStalkStatus (bits 12-15) never left 0 in the whole log, including the wiper button press at 16:49:47.9: the wiper button now reports through VCLEFT_switchStatus.VCLEFT_swcWiperButtonState.";
CM_ SG_ 585 SCCM_turnIndicatorStalkStatus "Enum changed: right tap (16:53:31) = 2 UP_1, left tap (16:53:34, 16:53:35) = 6 DOWN_1 (legacy DOWN_1 was 7).";
CM_ SG_ 585 SCCM_turnIndicatorStalkAngle "Raw stalk position, 4095 = SNA. Rest ~1800, UP_1 up to 1840, DOWN_1 down to 1761.";
CM_ BO_ 962 "Layout unchanged, vehicle + chassis bus, 20 Hz, no checksum. swcLeftScrollTicks read +1 x5 (16:49:50-16:49:59) then -1 x5 (16:50:01-16:50:09) during the wiper speed scroll. New VCLEFT_swcWiperButtonState.";
CM_ SG_ 962 VCLEFT_swcWiperButtonState "New on Juniper. HARD_PRESS for 180 ms at 16:49:47.94, which opened the wiper menu (UI_steeringButtonMode -> WIPERS) and triggered a single wipe. Replaces SCCM_washWipeButtonStatus; no checksum/counter in this frame.";
CM_ BO_ 1001 "Layout unchanged, vehicle + chassis bus, 2 Hz, bytesum checksum verified. DAS_wiperSpeed reads 15 while Autopilot is off and 0 while it is engaged (every 15 -> 0 edge lines up with DAS_autopilotState -> 3 and UI_wiperRequest -> AUTO), same as legacy.";
CM_ BO_ 991 "Layout unchanged, CHASSIS BUS ONLY on Juniper (legacy: vehicle bus). 2.5 Hz. UI_activeTouchPoints = 1/2/3/4 for the taps at 16:50:16-16:50:20 / 16:50:22-16:50:25 / 16:50:27-16:50:30 / 16:50:32-16:50:34; UI_touchDetected pulses with each tap.";
CM_ BO_ 627 "Layout unchanged, vehicle + chassis bus, 3 Hz. Verified UI_lockRequest (LOCK 16:50:47, UNLOCK 16:50:51 ... ), UI_mirrorFoldRequest (RETRACT 16:51:16, PRESENT 16:51:28), UI_wiperRequest (OFF -> AUTO -> ... -> FAST_CONTINUOUS -> OFF following the 16:49:50-16:50:09 scroll; AUTO whenever Autopilot is engaged), UI_steeringButtonMode = 6 WIPERS while the wiper menu was open (16:49:48-16:50:14). UI_remoteClosureRequest did not change for the trunk requests (they go through UI_vehicleControl2.UI_trunkRequest).";
CM_ BO_ 947 "CHANGED: DLC 2 -> 8, vehicle + chassis bus, 2 Hz. Known bit positions unchanged: UI_gloveboxRequest held ~3 s at 16:59:10.7 and 16:59:20.9; UI_trunkRequest pulsed ~0.7 s at 17:01:28.6, 17:01:35.5, 17:01:45.0, 17:01:50.6; UI_locksPanelActive 16:51:04-16:51:12. Idle payload 80 80 04 30 00 00 a8 80: bytes 4-7 carry new, unidentified fields (FW 2026.2 adds seat fan/auto-climate, steering wheel heat, wiper heater, ...), so a transmitter must send all 8 bytes (RMW the live frame).";
CM_ BO_ 819 "CHANGED: DLC 4 -> 5, vehicle + chassis bus, 2 Hz. Bits 0-25 unchanged (chargeEnableRequest 1, acChargeCurrentLimit 16 A, chargeTerminationPct 100 %). Bit 26 is constantly 1 (unidentified). Charge port open/close requests were not exercised in this log.";
CM_ SG_ 819 UI_cpInletHeaterRequest "Position verified, name inferred from FW 2026.2: 0 -> 1 when the supercharger navigation started (17:02:48.7), back to 0 when it was cancelled (17:03:01.2).";
CM_ BO_ 839 "Layout of byte 0 unchanged, vehicle bus only as 0x347 (the identical payload is mirrored on the chassis bus as 0x082). 1 Hz. Supercharger navigation 17:02:48.7 -> 17:03:01.2: byte 0 0x01 -> 0x02 (navToSupercharger) -> 0x0e (type 3 = V3) -> 0xae (preconditioning ACTIVE_HEAT + requestBatteryHeating) -> 0xaf -> 0x01. FW 2026.2 names: someValueA = UI_battPreconditionOnNavPowerReq (127 SNA, went to 0x50), someValueB = UI_battPreconditionOnNavTargetT (255 SNA, went to 0xd4), someValueC = UI_ambientTempAtDestination (-128 SNA while routing). Legacy names kept for firmware compatibility.";
CM_ SG_ 839 UI_tripPlanChargingTargetPercent "1023 = SNA (the only value seen).";
CM_ SG_ 839 UI_energyAtDestination "-327.68 = SNA (while routing). 55.61 kWh idle (= pack energy remaining), 53.79 kWh once the supercharger route was computed.";
CM_ BO_ 755 "CHANGED: DLC 5 -> 8 and CHASSIS BUS ONLY on Juniper (legacy: vehicle bus). 2 Hz. Old positions verified: setpoints 22.5 degC, blowerSegment 11 AUTO, userPowerState ON; UI_hvacReqSecondRowState OFF -> HIGH 17:02:09.7, LOW 17:02:14.7, HIGH 17:02:16.7, OFF 17:02:19.7, HIGH 17:02:22.5, OFF 17:02:27.9 (rear fan). Bytes 4-6 = 00 60 00 unidentified.";
CM_ SG_ 755 UI_hvacReqAutoBlowerLevel "New. With the fan in AUTO, the 17:00:18-17:00:29 fan adjustments stepped it 0 -> 2 -> 4 -> 2 -> 0.";
CM_ SG_ 755 UI_hvacClimateNudgeStatus "Position verified, name inferred from FW 2026.2: 2 (OPEN_NO_NUDGE) exactly while the climate panel was open (16:52:11-16:52:55, 16:59:39-17:00:33, 17:01:57-17:02:40), 0 otherwise.";
CM_ BO_ 820 "Layout unchanged, vehicle bus only, 2 Hz, bytesum checksum verified. UI_pedalMap CHILL -> SPORT 17:03:14.5, CHILL 17:03:18.0, SPORT 17:03:20.8, CHILL 17:03:22.6.";
CM_ BO_ 595 "CHANGED: DLC 7 -> 8, MULTIPLEXED on byte 0 and CHASSIS BUS ONLY on Juniper (legacy: vehicle bus). Mux 0 (front vents) and mux 1 (second row) alternate at ~2 Hz each. Mux 0 bytes 1-6 keep the legacy meaning: during the driver-vent drag 16:59:47-16:59:52 (SPLIT mode) LeftLateralSplit went 200 -> 20 -> 200 (left / fully right) and LeftPositionY 200 -> 123 -> 158 (up / down); LeftPositionX stayed 100. Byte 7 holds the native lateral modes. Mux 1 was constant (c8 b6 a9 c8 00 00 00); its signal order follows FW 2026.2 and is inferred. A single-slot RMW cache can hold either mux page: check byte 0 before reusing a live frame.";
CM_ SG_ 595 UI_ventPanelLeftLateralMode "SPLIT -> SWING 16:52:16.5 and 16:52:26.1, back to SPLIT 16:52:22.2 and 16:52:29.9.";
CM_ SG_ 595 UI_ventPanelRightLateralMode "SINGLE -> SWING 16:52:32.3 and 16:52:37.8, back to SINGLE 16:52:35.6 and 16:52:40.2.";
CM_ BO_ 297 "Layout unchanged, VEHICLE BUS ONLY on Juniper (DashKit manifest had bus 0). 100 Hz. SCCM_steeringAngle swept -199 .. +189 deg during the 16:52:48-16:52:53 wheel turns. Byte 0 is no longer the Tesla bytesum (renamed SCCM_steeringAngleCrc, same unknown algorithm as SCCM_leftStalkCrc). SCCM_steeringAngleValidity reads 0 throughout.";
CM_ BO_ 280 "Layout unchanged, vehicle + chassis bus, 100 Hz, bytesum checksum verified. DI_gear enum unchanged: D 16:53:01-16:53:07 (no reverse light, speed 0), R 16:54:36-16:54:38 and 17:01:01-17:01:07 (reverse light on, negative speed), P 17:01:24.7. DI_accelPedalPos 0 .. 100 % during the 16:51:58-16:52:04 pedal presses.";
CM_ BO_ 599 "Layout unchanged, vehicle + chassis bus, 50 Hz, bytesum checksum verified.";
CM_ BO_ 646 "Not in dbc/used_messages.txt; added for the DashPilot mapper (layout from bus_2_tesla_party.dbc). VEHICLE BUS ONLY on Juniper, 10 Hz, bytesum checksum (DI_locStatusChecksum) verified. DI_cruiseState = 2 ENABLED 16:55:20.7-16:55:30.0 (Autopilot engagement); DI_digitalSpeed is the set speed in DI_speedUnits (KPH on this car).";
CM_ BO_ 921 "Layout unchanged, chassis bus only (as in the DashKit manifest), 2 Hz, bytesum checksum verified. DAS_autopilotState = 3 16:55:20.7-16:55:30.0 (annotated engagement) plus later engagements at 16:55:53, 16:56:15, 16:57:57, 16:58:42, 16:59:57, 17:04:14.";
CM_ BO_ 905 "Layout unchanged, VEHICLE BUS ONLY on Juniper (DashKit manifest had bus 0). 2.4 Hz, bytesum checksum verified. DAS_lssState is 0/1 with Autopilot off (also while driving manually) and 3 or 7 while it is engaged.";
CM_ BO_ 605 "NOT AVAILABLE ON THIS CAR. 0x25D is 8 bytes at 10 Hz on vehicle + chassis bus (FW 2026.2: APP_trafficControl), but the payload is static (37 41 01 06 04 f0 xx 03, only byte 6 drifts 0xca-0xd1) through the yellow -> red (16:57:24-25) and red -> green (16:57:52) light changes and both stop-line approaches (16:54:55, 16:55:36). No other frame on any bus carried those transitions. The legacy signals are kept for app compatibility but decode to constants here.";
CM_ BO_ 994 "Layout unchanged (vehicle-bus copy, DLC 7, 5 Hz). VCLEFT_turnSignalStatus blinked 16:53:35.9-16:53:38.4. 0x3E2 on the chassis bus is a different 8-byte 1 Hz frame: decode this message from the vehicle bus only.";
CM_ BO_ 995 "CHANGED: DLC 2 -> 4, vehicle bus only, 5 Hz. Legacy bits verified (turnSignalStatus blinked 16:53:31.2-16:53:33.7, reverseLightStatus on 16:54:36-16:54:38 and 17:01:01-17:01:07). New 2-bit fields named from FW 2026.2: fasciaReverseLightStatus (13|2) reads 1 ON exactly while reversing, CHMSLLightStatus (29|2) reads 1 ON exactly while the brake light is on (field alignment inferred: bits 14 and 30 never set); bits 10 and 17 are set while the trunk is open (unidentified).";
CM_ BO_ 737 "Layout unchanged as far as observable, vehicle + chassis bus, 62 Hz. Mux-0 wiper fields follow the wiper session (wiperSpeed 1/2/8, wiperState 4/6/7/8/9/10). No door was opened; VCFRONT_anyClosureOpen / anyDoorOpen stayed 0 even while the trunk was open (17:01:28-17:01:56; VCRIGHT_doorStatus.VCRIGHT_trunkLatchStatus and VCLEFT_liftgateStatus did report it).";
CM_ BO_ 850 "Layout unchanged, vehicle bus only, 1.5 Hz. Mux 0: nominalFullPackEnergy 81.38 kWh, nominalEnergyRemaining 55.5 kWh at 16:56. A third mux page (index 2) now alternates with 0 and 1; not decoded.";
CM_ BO_ 594 "Layout unchanged, vehicle bus only, 10 Hz. maxRegenPower 98 kW, maxDischargePower 293.7 kW at 16:56. Legacy BMS_inverterTQF (56|2) dropped: it overlapped BMS_hvacPowerBudget (50|10) and bits 56-63 were always 0, so neither could be checked.";
CM_ BO_ 306 "CHANGED: DLC 8 -> 6, vehicle bus only, 100 Hz. packVoltage 381 V, packCurrent 1.9 A at 16:56. BMS_chgTimeToFull no longer fits and was removed.";
CM_ BO_ 818 "Layout unchanged, vehicle bus only, 1 Hz. Mux 0 thermistorTMax 18.0 / TMin 17.5 degC.";
CM_ BO_ 950 "CHANGED: DLC 4 -> 8, vehicle + chassis bus, 1 Hz. DI_odometer unchanged (3651.992 km). New counter (52|4) and bytesum checksum (56|8, verified on every frame); bits 32-51 read 0.";
CM_ BO_ 1029 "Layout unchanged, vehicle + chassis bus, 4 Hz. Index 16 = 4 NUL bytes + WMI (3 chars), 17 = chars 4-10, 18 = chars 11-17.";
